{"id": "sfusd-school-site-deposit-delays", "title": "Ten school receipts took one to five months to reach the bank", "seconds": 41.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "834ae4b3281a1297", "words": 133, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco schools held some receipts for months before bank deposit.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.7, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["How", "long", "until", "deposit?"], "sub": "Ten receipts took one to five months to reach the bank"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.78, 1.17, 1.37, 1.53, 1.9, 2.11, 2.43, 2.77, 3.02]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In the audit sample, 10 of 60 receipts arrived late.", "t0": 3.82, "t1": 6.8, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "audit", "layout": "table", "heading": "Combined sample", "context": "FY2023–24", "rows": [{"label": "Receipts tested", "value": "60"}, {"label": "Delayed", "value": "10"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.26, 0.53, 1.14, 1.39, 1.5, 1.89, 2.29, 2.72]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The delays ranged from one to five months.", "t0": 6.92, "t1": 9.05, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Ten receipts took one to five months to reach the bank", "text": "Time to deposit", "mark": "Time"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.59, 0.88, 1.06, 1.3, 1.41, 1.74]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "All the exceptions were at school sites.", "t0": 9.17, "t1": 11.03, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Ten receipts took one to five months to reach the bank", "text": "School sites", "mark": "School"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.36, 0.89, 1.05, 1.14, 1.43]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The district office checks passed the same review.", "t0": 11.15, "t1": 13.5, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Ten receipts took one to five months to reach the bank", "text": "District office", "mark": "District"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.56, 0.88, 1.22, 1.53, 1.66, 1.94]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The district proposed monthly checks on late deposits.", "t0": 13.72, "t1": 16.35, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "The school district proposed monthly checks on late deposits", "text": "Monthly review", "mark": "Monthly"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.93, 1.28, 1.64, 1.78, 1.99]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The auditors did not identify a cash shortage.", "t0": 16.47, "t1": 18.89, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "The school district proposed monthly checks on late deposits", "text": "Receipt custody", "mark": "Receipt"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.61, 0.82, 1.03, 1.61, 1.69, 1.97]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In March 2025, Accounting sent schools a new instruction.", "t0": 19.01, "t1": 22.6, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "memo", "layout": "table", "heading": "Accounting memo", "context": "March 5, 2025", "rows": [{"label": "Checks", "value": "District cashier"}, {"label": "School sites", "value": "Forward promptly"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.44, 0.71, 1.52, 2.02, 2.26, 2.68, 2.79, 2.97]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Checks and supporting records were to go directly to the district cashier.", "t0": 22.72, "t1": 26.12, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "memo", "kicker": "Accounting changed where schools were to send incoming checks", "text": "Checks to cashier", "mark": "Checks"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.42, 0.9, 1.24, 1.39, 1.49, 1.69, 2.22, 2.33, 2.46, 2.83]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Deposits were generally expected daily or within a few days.", "t0": 26.24, "t1": 29.51, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "memo", "kicker": "Accounting changed where schools were to send incoming checks", "text": "Normal timing", "mark": "Normal"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.7, 1.09, 1.63, 2.08, 2.3, 2.59, 2.66, 2.87]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The audit signed in 2026 marked the corrective action implemented.", "t0": 29.73, "t1": 33.21, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "The FY2025 audit records implementation", "text": "Follow-up audit", "mark": "Follow-up"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 0.79, 0.88, 1.19, 1.86, 2.09, 2.19, 2.63, 2.95]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The report did not publish how long later deposits took.", "t0": 33.33, "t1": 35.9, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "The FY2025 audit records implementation", "text": "Later deposit timing", "mark": "Later"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.43, 0.61, 0.81, 1.15, 1.35, 1.6, 1.85, 2.34]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "It did not say what the ten delayed receipts were worth.", "t0": 36.02, "t1": 38.58, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Amount undisclosed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.34, 0.53, 0.81, 0.97, 1.09, 1.31, 1.68, 2.08, 2.24]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 38.7, "t1": 40.81, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Ten receipts took one to five months to reach the bank", "b": "The school district proposed monthly checks on late deposits", "o": "The FY2025 audit records implementation"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "contrast"}